{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 359,
    "dDurationMs": 1291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Standing on the scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1650,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The wheel is spinning and it still weighs\n92 kilograms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5880,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You made the prediction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6880,
    "dDurationMs": 4759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let’s see what happens when I throw it up\nover my head in three, two, one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11639,
    "dDurationMs": 8331,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you think?I don’t know about you,\nbut to me it looked like a shaky mess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19970,
    "dDurationMs": 12620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let’s watch that again in slow-mo and I\nwill graph the scale readings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32590,
    "dDurationMs": 4950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As you can see, during the lift the scale\noscillates around 91 kilograms, the same as"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37540,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it read when I was stationary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39510,
    "dDurationMs": 4979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it seems the apparatus doesn’t get heavier\nor lighter when it is lifted while spinning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44489,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only large deviation from the average\ncomes at the end of the lift when I let the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48399,
    "dDurationMs": 2741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wheel fall so the scale reading drops."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51140,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I slow its descent and so the scale\nreading rises."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54540,
    "dDurationMs": 4949,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the question remains: If the wheel doesn’t\nget lighter, why does it feel lighter?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59489,
    "dDurationMs": 3471,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This demonstration was first performed by\nProfessor Eric Laithwaite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62960,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Listen to how he describes it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64360,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So here goes 40 pounds of wheel as light\nas a feather."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67290,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is not a conjuring trick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69670,
    "dDurationMs": 4199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a fact of science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73869,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e He sure makes it look easy, doesn’t he?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76259,
    "dDurationMs": 1061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Watch it again carefully."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77320,
    "dDurationMs": 9130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A fact about a spinning wheel so far everyone\nhas missed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86450,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Professor Laithwaite claims the gyroscope’s\nproperties couldn’t be fully explained by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90330,
    "dDurationMs": 1789,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Newton’s laws of motion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92119,
    "dDurationMs": 1111,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I disagree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93230,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in order to understand why the wheel feels\nso light, we first have to consider why it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97820,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "feels heavy when it is not spinning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99390,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So two handed that is as far down the shaft\nas you can hold it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102410,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103410,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Holding the shaft horizontally you clearly\nneed to provide an upward force equal to the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106360,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "downward weight of the wheel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108060,
    "dDurationMs": 3730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this is not enough, because with only\nthese two forces there would be a neck torque"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111790,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "causing the apparatus to rotate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113360,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you need to create a counter torque in\naddition to supporting the weight of the wheel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117920,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This requires pushing down with one hand and\npulling up with the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121580,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the upward force must be greater than\nthe downward force by an amount equal to the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125270,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "weight of the wheel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126270,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the force on each of your hands is significantly\ngreater than the weight of the wheel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130890,
    "dDurationMs": 3929,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now once the wheel is spinning the torque\ndue to its weight now causes it to process"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134819,
    "dDurationMs": 1641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather than fall to the ground."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136460,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore, no counter torque is necessary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138920,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You only need to supply an upward force equal\nto the wheel’s weight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142450,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it feels lighter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143790,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the trick to lifting a wheel over your\nhead is to push it forwards as you release"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147540,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148540,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Laithwaite knew this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149540,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you force a gyroscope to process faster,\nit lifts up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153260,
    "dDurationMs": 1699,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Higher the procession and it rises."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154959,
    "dDurationMs": 4701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e But the weight doesn’t change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159660,
    "dDurationMs": 3689,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Similarly, if you slow the procession of a\ngyroscope, it goes down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163349,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Slow the procession and it falls dramatically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166560,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I showed you right?\u003e\u003e"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168750,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now show it to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171060,
    "dDurationMs": 5050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Hard to go back the way that it doesn’t\nwant to process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176110,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e [unintelligible]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177110,
    "dDurationMs": 5459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you can’t say it becomes as light as\na feather when it is rising."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182569,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It certainly doesn’t become as light\nas a feather."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184319,
    "dDurationMs": 3071,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can say that, too, from having felt it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187390,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it does feel lighter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189660,
    "dDurationMs": 3290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think, maybe, part of that has to do\nwith the fact that I am not having to counter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192950,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the torque with my hand, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195450,
    "dDurationMs": 4929,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All I have to do is support the weight of\nthe disc, but I don’t need to provide any"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200379,
    "dDurationMs": 5341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "torque with my hand to counter that gravitational\npart, which is what makes it feel so awkward"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205720,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you are trying to hold it when it is\nstatic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207840,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e When you apply a torque, as you were, then\nthe force up on one side of the hand and down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212380,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the other side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214290,
    "dDurationMs": 7649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you decrease the force on both sides,\nthen it will actually feel lighter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221939,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It feels lighter without actually getting\nlighter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223879,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224879,
    "dDurationMs": 6920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What it does is to take first the apparent\nweight that you were feeling."
    } ]
  } ]
}
